{"id":"745eb7467d12954f","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-top3-sigma-compact-space.md","title":"ZFC Top3 Sigma Compact Space","display":"df-zfc-top3-sigma-compact-space — ZFC Top3 Sigma Compact Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top3-sigma-compact-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top3-sigma-compact-space"],"display":"df-zfc-top3-sigma-compact-space — ZFC Top3 Sigma Compact Space","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top3-sigma-compact-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top3-sigma-compact-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top3-sigma-compact-space — ZFC Top3 Sigma Compact Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"67cf48a2f6e27861\" href=\"?note=67cf48a2f6e27861\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3SigmaCompactSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop3SigmaCompactSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top3\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}compact\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop3SigmaCompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\exists F\\;(F:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(X)\\land X=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F(n)\\land \\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(F(n),X,\\tau))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top3\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}compact\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop3SigmaCompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\exists F\\;(F:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(X)\\land X=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F(n)\\land \\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(F(n),X,\\tau))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 是可数多个在环境拓扑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 中紧的子集之并；这些紧子集不要求两两不交或递增。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","loc